# Agenda and the command line

Every note feeds wtf query @today, wtf query @week, and wtf query @tasks.

- [ ] Send the invoice @due(2026-09-18) #finance
- [ ] Renew the domain @due(2026-09-30) @every(year) #admin
- [ ] Draft the talk @scheduled(2026-09-19) @estimate(2h)
- Standup @at(2026-09-18T09:00-04:00)

<!-- wtf query 'map(filter(tasks, fn(t) => contains(t.tags, "finance")), fn(t) => t.title)'
filters and projects with the same functions as notes. Add --in 29-agenda-and-cli.wtf
for this file, or use wtf ast 29-agenda-and-cli.wtf and wtf graph 29-agenda-and-cli.wtf
for syntax and dependencies. Queries are read-only. wtf query @check --fail-on-match
reports errors; wtf query plans reads solutions; wtf refresh fills caches.
Add --json to a query for structured output. -->
